{"v":2,"catch":"回到文藝復興時期的義大利佛羅倫斯，去解開一個關於「永生」的古老秘密。","desc":"十幾年前的一場大戰之後，整個歐洲大陸百廢待興。在義大利的佛羅倫斯，隱藏著一個關於「永生」的古老秘密，一張編織百年的黑暗之網，正悄然展開。\n\n那傳說中的救贖，究竟是恩賜，還是詛咒？\n\n擁有過人智慧的你，某一天與一名擁有雪白頭髮、如魔女般美麗的女子相遇，命運的齒輪便開始轉動。","publisher":"Happy Player","release":"2025-12-11","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 1.0GB / Switch 1.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8d16807ccc878261a4fe19946513546150f3bf18ccfc60a022faa4416bed263.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e3955237dcdfa7314254baada1645dafa8ef452cbab0db146e6dae97a2b629f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4008be3bc97a99926247e80ad3dd9fa24498cc9fc2dcd64059982e419576b536.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fb50c68c6ada3cd1421a1c040b5260badafca28947dd90e55929b40b9c3a43b8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/74528459a5fc5304bd1c5d0132cc793bbe77e273775f62faddad2bf73efa1775.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1bc22a5a116c27a7dc5346160a0cc092a48134affaf62ac84f689f8d2ffde71c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100533023194000"}